"text": "[image: #jasmineforport Jasmine Vasavada Jasmine for Port of Olympia]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/CyuH7OlOjrp/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Beth Doglio | Democrat for State Rep]",
"href": "https://www.bethdoglio.com/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Both my mom and dad were teachers–and I was a proud PTA president. There’s no doubt: I-2117 would be terrible for kids and educators. We should be investing in our children’s futures–not gutting these vital funds. Obviously! https://no2117.com/]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-l17KGxGXb/"
},
{
"text": "[image: GOTV GO TIME PART 2: On Sunday, we're co-hosting a GOTV canvassing event with the Strickland and Bateman campaigns. We'll meet at 11am at Olympia Lamplighters (211 4th Ave E) for a quick how-to and then head out to the doors!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Ckj16rPLVWM/"
},
{
"text": "[image: I can't say enough about this phenomenal team. It was wonderful to see so many of you at our first summer Weekend of Action, where we reached an incredible 17,000 voters across our beautiful state. And guess what? We're hitting the pavement again this weekend! Be part of this team that I am so proud of: https://www.mobilize.us/no2117/]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C_BkiazhEXF/"
},
{
"text": "[image: It's GOTV GO TIME! Join me this Saturday for a rally with Senator Patty Murray, Congresswoman Marilyn Strickland, and Representative Jessica Bateman for a GOTV push. We'll meet at Heritage Park at 3pm for a short rally and then go out to canvass in Olympia.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/CkhX_QOsQ6m/"
},
{
"text": "[image: It’s go time. Have you voted? Too much is at stake. Choice. Affirmative action. Our environment. Our equality. Our democracy.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/CkeTdu5SdQC/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Love, love, love Pride in Olympia!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C822NgCtm7_/"
},
{
"text": "[image: My cat helped me officially file to run for re-election this morning. I think she's happy to continue helping me represent the 22nd LD as best I can!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C6olL4bRfzV/"
},
{
"text": "[image: The small but mighty 1980 east ridge hs orchestra unites again! Happy 60th (well 59.5) birthday Amanda Thomas!!! Very fun to celebrate you. Music, art, dance, laughter, and friendship. How blessed we are. Jessica L. Madsen Barbara Gustafson]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C8WHgKXxXUB/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Thrilled to be the Washington Conservation Action Legislator of the Year! For over 30 years, fighting climate change and protecting our lands has been my life’s work. And, there’s always more work to be done. Thank you for your support, WCA!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C6w_KTpt_PY/"
